CORE
main.c

^EXIT=(64|1)$
^SIGNAL=0$
^CONVERSION ERROR$
array size of static symbol 'a' is not constant$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A division the simplifier cannot fold (1/0) is not a constant expression, so
make_constant must reject it as a file-scope array size.  This pins down that
the operators added for Clang __builtin_constant_p folding live only in
clang_is_constant_foldedt, keeping the shared base predicate (and hence
make_constant) unchanged.
